## 1. Third-party software NOT distributed here

The following are **required at runtime for specific modules** but are **not
included, vendored, or redistributed** in this repository. Users install them
themselves, as documented in `README.md` and `requirements/`.

| Component | Licence | Used by | Distributed here? |
|---|---|---|---|
| [Pangolin](https://github.com/tkzeng/Pangolin) (Zeng & Li) | **GPL-3.0** | `pipeline/run_pangolin_cross.py` (imports `pangolin.model`) | ❌ No — installed by the user |
| [Retina-SpliceAI](https://github.com/cmbi/Retina-SpliceAI) (Riepe et al., CMBI/Radboud UMC) | **GPL-3.0** | `pipeline/splice_neural.py` loads its `.h5` weights | ❌ No — weights copied locally by the user, git-ignored |
| [SpliceAI](https://github.com/Illumina/SpliceAI) (Illumina) | GPL-3.0 | `pipeline/splice_neural.py` | ❌ No — installed from PyPI |
| ViennaRNA | own licence | `pipeline/thermodynamics.py`, `structure_layout.py` | ❌ No — installed via conda |
| NCBI BLAST+ | public domain (US Gov) | `pipeline/off_target.py` | ❌ No — installed via conda |

**On the GPL dependencies.** Only one file in this repository imports GPL-licensed
code: `pipeline/run_pangolin_cross.py`. The core module `pipeline/pangolin_cross.py`
does not, and `pipeline/run_masking.py` imports the adapter lazily, only when the
`pangolin` predictor is selected. No GPL source or model weights are distributed
here — the user installs them separately. Anyone redistributing this repository
**together with** Pangolin or Retina-SpliceAI should review GPL-3.0 obligations
for that combined distribution.

